      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are these reachabilityfences necessary? And even if they are, could they be replaced with a @ReachabilitySensitive annotation on mMapFd? That would keep the code cleaner and make it easier for others to modify in the future even if whoever makes those modifications does not understand the semantics of reachabilityFence (example: I don\u0027t think I do).",
